         'de':'Comprehensive SEO optimization for an e-commerce store with 200% organic traffic increase.',
         'sid':sec_market.id,'subid':sub_seo.id,'cover':imgs['seo1']},
        {'ta':'استراتيجية محتوى لشركة','te':'Content Strategy for Corp',
